class="lf-h1"&gt;一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題）<span class="star">⭐</span></div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>Symmetry圖形摺埋之後，兩邊會＿＿＿＿（一模一樣 / 唔同）。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>一個心形 ❤️ 左右兩半係咪Symmetry？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>Square有幾多條Symmetry軸？A. 1條 B. 2條 C. 4條</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>Rectangle有幾多條Symmetry軸？A. 1條 B. 2條 C. 4條（提示：同Square唔同！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>Circle形有幾多條Symmetry軸？（提示：任何穿過Circle心嘅直線都係！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：軸Symmetry係咩？<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐ 最重要</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>軸Symmetry：</strong>一個圖形沿住一條直線對摺，兩邊<strong>完全重合</strong><br/>
② <strong>Symmetry軸：</strong>嗰條用來對摺嘅直線<br/>
③ <strong>檢驗方法：</strong>想像將圖形沿線對摺，兩邊係咪完全一樣？<br/>
④ <strong>日常生活：</strong>蝴蝶、樹葉、心形、人臉（大約）都係Symmetry！
</div></div>
<div class="symmetry-demo">
<div class="item">🦋<div class="lf-ex-label">蝴蝶<br/>1條Symmetry軸</div></div>
<div class="item">❤️<div class="lf-ex-label">心形<br/>1條Symmetry軸</div></div>
<div class="item">⬛<div class="lf-ex-label">Square<br/>4條Symmetry軸</div></div>
<div class="item">📏<div class="lf-ex-label">Rectangle<br/>2條Symmetry軸</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1：辨別Symmetry圖形</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">以下哪些是軸Symmetry圖形？A. Square B. Parallelogram C. 等邊Triangle D. Trapezoid</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">A. Square → <strong>係！</strong>有 4 條Symmetry軸<br/>B. Parallelogram → <strong>唔係！</strong>（一般Parallelogram冇Symmetry軸）<br/>C. 等邊Triangle → <strong>係！</strong>有 3 條Symmetry軸<br/>D. Trapezoid → <strong>睇情況！</strong>等腰Trapezoid有 1 條，一般Trapezoid冇</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 常見Trap：以為所有四邊形都有Symmetry軸！Parallelogram（非特殊）係冇Symmetry軸㗎！</div>
<div class="lf-tip">💡 快速檢查法：拎張紙，畫個圖形，試下摺！如果能完全重疊 → 有Symmetry軸！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>以下邊啲係軸Symmetry圖形？A. Circle形 B. 不等邊Triangle C. 等腰Triangle D. Square</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>英文字母「A」有Symmetry軸嗎？「B」呢？「C」呢？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>一個等邊Triangle有幾多條Symmetry軸？畫出嚟！</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：找Symmetry軸<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>Square：4 條Symmetry軸</strong>（2條對邊中點連線 + 2條對角線）<br/>
② <strong>Rectangle：2 條Symmetry軸</strong>（2條對邊中點連線，對角線唔係！）<br/>
③ <strong>等邊Triangle：3 條</strong>（每條由頂點到底邊中點）<br/>
④ <strong>Circle形：無限多條</strong>（任何穿過Circle心嘅直線都係！）<br/>
⑤ <strong>等腰Triangle：1 條</strong>（由頂點到底邊中點）
</div></div>
<div class="chart-wrap">
<svg height="240" viewbox="0 0 280 260" width="260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="210" stroke="none" stroke-width="0" width="210" x="35" y="15"></rect><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="35" x2="35" y1="15" y2="225"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="70" x2="70" y1="15" y2="225"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="105" x2="105" y1="15" y2="225"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="140" x2="140" y1="15" y2="225"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="175" x2="175" y1="15" y2="225"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="210" x2="210" y1="15" y2="225"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="245" x2="245" y1="15" y2="225"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="35" x2="245" y1="15" y2="15"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="35" x2="245" y1="50" y2="50"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="35" x2="245" y1="85" y2="85"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="35" x2="245" y1="120" y2="120"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="35" x2="245" y1="155" y2="155"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="35" x2="245" y1="190" y2="190"></line><line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.8" x1="35" x2="245" y1="225" y2="225"></line><rect fill="none" height="210" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="210" x="35" y="15"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="140" y="243">6 格 × 6 格 Symmetry繪圖格</text></svg>
</div>
<div style="font-size:13px;text-align:center;color:var(--gray);">（Symmetry繪圖格：左邊畫咩，右邊要畫鏡像！）</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 2：Symmetry軸的數量</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">Rectangle有幾多條Symmetry軸？畫出嚟！</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">Rectangle有 <strong>2 條</strong>Symmetry軸：<br/>1. 穿過左右兩邊中點嘅垂直線<br/>2. 穿過上下兩邊中點嘅水平線<br/>（注意：對角線<strong>唔係</strong>Rectangle嘅Symmetry軸！因為沿對角線摺，兩邊唔會重合！）</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>Square有幾多條Symmetry軸？畫出全部。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>等腰Triangle有幾多條Symmetry軸？不等邊Triangle呢？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>在方格紙上（上面 6x6 格），畫一個Symmetry圖形（左右Symmetry）。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>正五邊形有幾多條Symmetry軸？試下畫！（提示：同正五邊形嘅頂點數量有關）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：畫Symmetry圖形<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>用方格紙：</strong>先畫Symmetry軸，然後逐格點畫鏡像<br/>
② <strong>規律：</strong>Symmetry軸左邊嘅點，右邊相同距離要有對應點<br/>
③ <strong>用摺紙法：</strong>實際摺一張紙，剪出形狀，打開就係Symmetry圖形！<br/>
④ <strong>P3 重點：</strong>左右Symmetry（垂直Symmetry軸）最常見
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 3：畫Symmetry圖形</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">在方格紙上，Symmetry軸在正中間（垂直）。左邊第 2 行第 3 格填了顏色。右邊Symmetry位置係邊格？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">Symmetry軸喺正中間（第3和第4行之間）<br/>左邊第 2 行 → 右邊Symmetry = 倒數第 2 行 = 第 5 行<br/>答案：<strong>右邊第 5 行第 3 格</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-game">
<div style="font-size:24px;">🎮 Symmetry摺紙遊戲！</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">拎一張紙 → 對摺 → 剪一個形狀 → 打開！<br/>你剪出嚟嘅形狀一定係Symmetry㗎！試下剪唔同嘅形狀！</div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>Symmetry軸係一條＿＿線，圖形沿佢對摺後兩邊會＿＿。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>Square有＿＿條Symmetry軸。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>以下邊個數字有Symmetry軸？ 0, 1, 2, 3, 8（提示：諗下沿橫線摺）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>一個正六邊形有幾多條Symmetry軸？（提示：3條穿過對角 + 3條穿過對邊中點）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>Rectangle嘅對角線係咪Symmetry軸？用摺紙法解釋！（提示：諗下Rectangle沿對角線摺會點？）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>在方格紙上畫一個「十」字形。呢個圖形有幾多條Symmetry軸？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>一個Rhombus（四條邊相等但唔係Square）有幾多條Symmetry軸？畫出嚟證明！</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>在方格紙上，完成一個左右Symmetry的圖案：左半邊已畫，請畫出右半邊的鏡像。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>摺紙挑戰：用一張紙，對摺一次，剪一刀。打開後得到咩形狀？如果對摺兩次（十字摺），再剪一刀呢？試下！（提示：對摺次數越多，圖案越複雜！）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">四、生活Word Problems（共 5 題）<span class="star">🎯</span></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>🦋 搵出屋企 3 樣Symmetry嘅物品。（例如：碟、杯、書...）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>🔤 寫出 5 個有Symmetry軸嘅大寫英文字母。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">24</td><td>🪞 企喺鏡前面：你的左邊喺鏡入面變成右邊。呢個係咪Symmetry？Symmetry軸喺邊？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>✂️ 用摺紙+剪刀，創作出一個Symmetry圖案。貼喺下面！描述你的創作過程。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>🏛️ 觀察建築物：好多建築物嘅正面係左右Symmetry嘅。搵一個例子，畫出佢嘅外形，標示Symmetry軸。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">五、Homework （課後完成）<span class="star">📝</span></div>
<div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)題（共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>Circle形有幾多條Symmetry軸？A. 1條 B. 2條 C. 無限多</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>Square和Rectangle，邊個Symmetry軸多啲？多幾多？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>人體（外表）大約有幾多條Symmetry軸？係咩方向？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>以下圖形有冇Symmetry軸？如有，有幾多條？A. 等腰Trapezoid B. Parallelogram</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>摺紙實驗：對摺一張紙一次，剪一個半心形。打開後係咩形狀？有幾多條Symmetry軸？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)題（共 3 題）</div>
