<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>正八邊形（stop sign 形狀）有幾多條Symmetry軸？（提示：4條穿過對角 + 4條穿過對邊中點）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>在方格紙上設計一個有 2 條Symmetry軸的圖案（上下Symmetry + 左右Symmetry）。畫出你的設計。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>雪花 ❄️ 通常有 6 條Symmetry軸。你能用摺紙方法（對摺 3 次）剪出一個六角Symmetry嘅雪花嗎？試下！</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error</th><th>Correct Approach</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Square只有1條Symmetry軸</strong></td><td>Square有 4 條！2條中線 + 2條對角線</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Rectangle對角線係Symmetry軸</strong></td><td>Rectangle只有 2 條Symmetry軸（中線），對角線唔係！</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>所有Triangle都有Symmetry軸</strong></td><td>只有等腰和等邊Triangle先有Symmetry軸</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Parallelogram有Symmetry軸</strong></td><td>一般Parallelogram冇Symmetry軸（Rhombus除外）</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Symmetry只可以左右</strong></td><td>Symmetry軸可以係垂直、水平、或者斜嘅！</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>畫鏡像時距離計錯</strong></td><td>Symmetry軸兩邊嘅對應點，距離必定相同</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>Circle形只有2條或4條Symmetry軸</strong></td><td>任何穿過Circle心嘅直線都係Symmetry軸 → 無限多條</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic一：「Square有四條，長方只得二；三角要等腰，Circle形無限次！」</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic二：「Symmetry軸係摺線，兩邊一模一樣；方格紙上畫鏡像，距離相同要記帳！」</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">①</div><div class="t">睇圖形</div><div class="d">係咩形狀？</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">②</div><div class="t">想像摺</div><div class="d">沿邊條線摺會重疊？</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">③</div><div class="t">數Symmetry軸</div><div class="d">有幾多條？</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">④</div><div class="t">摺紙驗證</div><div class="d">實際摺下！</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-tip" style="text-align:center;font-size:14px;">🌟 Symmetry係大自然最鍾意嘅設計！由蝴蝶到花朵，由雪花到人臉，Symmetry無處不在！你係Symmetry小發現家！🦋✨</div>
